      "source": "https://talktoannie.com/discover-cannelton-indiana-a-riverside-town-steeped-in-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Along the Ohio River, Cannelton thrived as a steamboat stop, linking commerce and culture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://talktoannie.com/discover-cannelton-indiana-a-riverside-town-steeped-in-history/"
    },
    {
